cket auto-reconnect, CORS middleware |\n230: | **AdBlock Proxy** | `socketserver.ThreadingMixIn` multi-worker | Socket timeouts, non-blocking selector, graceful fallback |\n231: | **Web Traffic Logger** | Thread-Safe with `threading.Lock()` | Atomic JSON flush, max-capacity queue capping |\n232: | **Network Tracer** | Cached reverse DNS & ASN dictionary | ThreadPoolExecutor for lookups, timeout guards |\n233: | **Threat Detector** | Worker thread pool / batch process inspection | AccessDenied catchers, PID expiration handling |\n234: | **Policy Engine** | Atomic file writes | Pre-loaded in-memory set matching |\n235: \n236: ---\n237: \n238: ## 5. Port Allocations & File System Layout\n239: \n240: - **Port `8888`:** SOC Cyber Dashboard REST API & WebSocket Server.\n241: - **Port `8080`:** High-speed AdBlock Intercepting Web Proxy.\n242: - **Root Directory:** `c:\\Users\\thann\\Downloads\\AntiGravity\\SpywareProcessMon`\n243: - **Database Directory:** `database/` (JSON persistence).\n244: - **Screenshots Directory:** `screenshots/` (Visual captures).\n245: - **Brain Archive:** `brain_archive/` (Full conversation, transcript, plan preservation).\n246: "}
