{"step_index":433,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-07T06:47:59Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-07T07:47:59+01:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-07T07:47:59+01:00\nShowing lines 130-174 of 174\n130: | `/api/email/send-report` | `POST` | Triggers immediate compilation and dispatch of executive HTML report. | `POST /api/email/send-report` |\n131: \n132: ---\n133: \n134: ## 4. WebSocket Telemetry Protocol\n135: \n136: - **Endpoint:** `ws://127.0.0.1:8888/ws/telemetry`\n137: - **Streaming Frequency:** Pushes live metrics every 2.0 seconds.\n138: - **Payload Schema:**\n139: ```json\n140: {\n141:   \"type\": \"TELEMETRY_UPDATE\",\n142:   \"timestamp\": 1794033150.21,\n143:   \"metrics\": {\n144:     \"system_health_index\": 98.5,\n145:     \"active_threats_count\": 0,\n146:     \"total_processes\": 142,\n147:     \"network_processes_count\": 18,\n148:     \"adblock_requests_total\": 450,\n149:     \"adblock_blocked_total\": 118,\n150:     \"bandwidth_saved_mb\": 28.4\n151:   },\n152:   \"critical_alerts\": []\n153: }\n154: ```\n155: \n156: ---\n157: \n158: ## 5. Helpful Windows Administration Commands\n159: \n160: ### 5.1 Inspect Windows Internet Settings Proxy\n161: ```powershell\n162: Get-ItemProperty -Path \"HKCU:\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Internet Settings\" | Select-Object ProxyEnable, ProxyServer\n163: ```\n164: \n165: ### 5.2 Inspect Active Windows Firewall Rules Added by AegisShield\n166: ```powershell\n167: netsh advfirewall firewall show rule name=all | Select-String \"AegisShield\" -Context 0,4\n168: ```\n169: \n170: ### 5.3 Verify Listening Ports for EDR and AdBlocker\n171: ```powershell\n172: netstat -ano | findstr \"8888 8080\"\n173: ```\n174: "}
